  "description": "Add a fun, energetic, and shiny touch to your design projects with Bubble Gloss! Featuring bold, rounded letterforms accented with adorable 3D glossy highlights, this chunky bubble font is handcrafted to make your titles pop off the page.\nImmerse your designs in a world of playful dynamism and gleaming accents with Bubble Gloss! This unique font brings to life bold, rounded alphabets adorned with captivating 3D glossy highlights. Handcrafted to perfection, this thick-set bubble font ensures your titles burst with character, vivacity and an unmissable shine. With Bubble Gloss, every creative endeavor takes on a spirited, visually striking appeal, where the chunky, round-edged letterforms and lifelike 3D gloss make your titles leap out from every screen and paper they grace.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Add a fun, energetic, and shiny touch to your design projects with Bubble Gloss! Featuring bold, rounded letterforms accented with adorable 3D glossy highlights, this chunky bubble font is handcrafted to make your titles pop off the page.</p>\n<p>Immerse your designs in a world of playful dynamism and gleaming accents with Bubble Gloss! This unique font brings to life bold, rounded alphabets adorned with captivating 3D glossy highlights. Handcrafted to perfection, this thick-set bubble font ensures your titles burst with character, vivacity and an unmissable shine. With Bubble Gloss, every creative endeavor takes on a spirited, visually striking appeal, where the chunky, round-edged letterforms and lifelike 3D gloss make your titles leap out from every screen and paper they grace.</p>",
